# Component catalog — {{PRODUCT_NAME}}

> The contract for every reusable UI component. Before building a new screen,
> check here first. Before adding a component, add its spec here. Every entry
> must be rendered in the Style Gallery screen.

For each component document: **purpose · variants · states · tokens used · do/don't**.

---

## Button

- **Purpose:** primary action trigger.
- **Variants:** `primary`, `secondary`, `text`, `danger`.
- **States:** default, hover/pressed, disabled, loading.
- **Tokens:** `component.button.*`, `semantic.color.*`, `radius.control`.
- **Do:** one `primary` button per view. **Don't:** invent new colors per screen.

## Card

- **Purpose:** group related content on a surface.
- **Variants:** `flat`, `elevated`.
- **States:** default, selected, disabled.
- **Tokens:** `component.card.*`.

## TextField

- **Purpose:** single-line/multiline input.
- **Variants:** `default`, `error`.
- **States:** empty, focused, filled, error, disabled.
- **Tokens:** `semantic.color.surface/onSurface/danger`, `radius.control`, `space.gutter`.

## ListItem / Row

- **Purpose:** repeated row in lists.
- **Variants:** `oneLine`, `twoLine`, `withTrailing`.

## AppScaffold (adaptive)

- **Purpose:** top-level shell. Bottom bar (Compact) ↔ rail/drawer (Expanded).
- **Tokens:** `semantic.color.background/surface`, `space.section`.

